{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50764","headline":"洛阳春望 · 张祜","name":"洛阳春望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世事空悲衰复荣，慿音一望更添情。\n红颜只向爱中尽，芳草先从愁处生。\n佳气蔼空迷鳯阙，绿杨抵水挠宫城。\n（「挠」，严疑当作「绕」。\n）游执行驻马烟花外，玉笛不利何处声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50764.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50764","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}